WEBVTT

NOTE Timed to the voice in the narrated master (word timings measured 10 November 2026; see SCENE_01_QC.md).

00:01.280 --> 00:03.200
One label.

00:05.400 --> 00:06.500
One record.

00:06.500 --> 00:10.000
Twenty-nine of thirty-two tests have their evidence.

